{% comment %}
  Longeva service hero block.

  Renders H1 (product title), short description and price-from from the
  linked service metaobject (custom.service_ref), plus a regulatory line
  and a primary CTA placeholder that Sesami's app block sits next to.

  Falls back to product.title and product.description if no service_ref
  is linked.
{% endcomment %}

{% liquid
  assign service = product.metafields.custom.service_ref.value
  assign heading = product.title
  assign short_description = ''
  comment
    Default fallback so a product with no linked service_ref metaobject
    (e.g. Adrenaline Nasal Spray, Jet Lag, Thrush — see
    sections/longeva-service-layout-product.liquid's own note that these
    stay on this older layout) never renders with zero consultation/
    safety framing. A linked service_ref's own regulatory_line still
    takes priority when set.
  endcomment
  assign regulatory_line = 'This is a consultation-led service. A pharmacist assesses suitability before anything is supplied or treated.'
  if service
    if service.name != blank
      assign heading = service.name
    endif
    assign short_description = service.short_description
    if service.regulatory_line != blank
      assign regulatory_line = service.regulatory_line
    endif
  endif
  comment
    CTA label by product type. Vaccines book a "vaccination"; every other
    service type (consultations, and minor ailments such as the adrenaline
    nasal spray) books an "appointment". One shared template, two readings.
  endcomment
  assign cta_label = block.settings.cta_label
  assign ptype = product.type | downcase
  unless ptype contains 'vaccin'
    if ptype != blank
      assign cta_label = 'Book this appointment'
    endif
  endunless
  comment
    The product price IS the 25% booking deposit (not the full fee). The
    full treatment price is shown as deposit x 4 so the 25% relationship
    is always consistent and is computed live from the deposit price.
  endcomment
  assign full_money = product.price | times: 4 | money
  comment
    Booking. The top CTA opens the Sesami slot picker inline (no page
    hop to /pages/book, which was the "book again" extra step Varsha
    flagged 3 June). It carries this vaccine's own variant so the
    deposit shown is the deposit booked, plus a Vaccine property so the
    clinician sees which vaccine. Service id falls back to the travel
    health consultation service used across the site; shop id resolves
    from the global Sesami setting inside the snippet.
  endcomment
%}

<div class="longeva-service-hero" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="longeva-service-hero__content">
    <h1 class="longeva-service-hero__heading">{{ heading | escape }}</h1>

    {% if short_description != blank %}
      <p class="longeva-service-hero__description">{{ short_description | strip_html | strip }}</p>
    {% endif %}

    {%- comment -%}
      The product price is the 25% booking deposit, not the full
      treatment fee (Varsha 28 May: payable figure did not read as 25%).
      Label it as a deposit and state the balance is settled on the day.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if product.price > 0 -%}
    <p class="longeva-service-hero__price">
      <span class="longeva-service-hero__price-label">Treatment price from</span>
      <span class="longeva-service-hero__price-value">{{ full_money }}</span>
    </p>
    <p class="longeva-service-hero__price-note">Booked through a travel health consultation, which confirms exactly what you need. Your vaccination is given and settled at the appointment.</p>
    {%- else -%}
    <p class="longeva-service-hero__price">
      <span class="longeva-service-hero__price-label longeva-service-hero__price-label--placeholder">Price assessed at consultation</span>
    </p>
    {%- endif -%}

    {% if regulatory_line != blank %}
      <p class="longeva-service-hero__regulatory">{{ regulatory_line }}</p>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="longeva-service-hero__cta">
      {%- comment -%}
        The per-vaccine variant is not registered in Sesami, so the
        inline widget 404s on availability lookup and shows "Something
        went wrong". Until the vaccine products are made bookable in the
        Sesami dashboard, route booking to the consultation page (the
        only registered Sesami service). Blank service id makes the
        snippet render a link to fallback_url. cta_label carries its
        schema default.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {% render 'longeva-sesami-button',
         service_id: '',
         variant_id: product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id,
         label: cta_label,
         variant: 'primary',
         prop_name: 'Vaccine',
         prop_value: product.title,
         fallback_url: '/pages/travel-health-consultation-manchester' %}
    </div>

    {%- comment -%}
      Rich "what is this" body. The service metaobject rich fields are
      still being populated, so product.description is the dependable
      source. This surfaces the structured copy that the SEO meta already
      carried but the page body was dropping.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {% if product.description != blank %}
      <div class="longeva-service-hero__about rte">{{ product.description }}</div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  .longeva-service-hero {
    padding-block: 1.5rem;
  }
  .longeva-service-hero__heading {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .longeva-service-hero__description {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-foreground-subdued, currentColor);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .longeva-service-hero__price {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .longeva-service-hero__price-label {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-foreground-subdued, currentColor);
  }
  .longeva-service-hero__price-value {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .longeva-service-hero__price-note {
    margin: -0.5rem 0 1rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-foreground-subdued, currentColor);
    max-width: 42ch;
  }
  .longeva-service-hero__regulatory {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-foreground-subdued, currentColor);
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .longeva-service-hero__cta {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  .longeva-service-hero__cta-placeholder {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    border: 1px dashed var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-foreground-subdued, currentColor);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }
  .longeva-service-hero__about {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .longeva-service-hero__about p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .longeva-service-hero__about strong {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Longeva service hero",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Reads from product.metafields.custom.service_ref. Falls back to product title and description when no service is linked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "sesami_service_id",
      "label": "Sesami service ID",
      "info": "Numeric ID from Sesami admin. Leave blank to fall back to the URL below."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "cta_label",
      "label": "CTA label",
      "default": "Book this vaccination"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "cta_url",
      "label": "Fallback CTA URL"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
